This is the easiest way to remember it:

Architecture	Question it answers
Microservices	Where are the boundaries between independently deployable services?
Hexagonal	How do I protect the business logic inside a service from external dependencies?
Layered Architecture	How do responsibilities flow between layers?
Event-driven architecture	How do services communicate asynchronously?
CQRS	How do we separate read and write models when appropriate?

You can combine all of them.